---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import Fact from "../components/Fact.astro";
import { facts } from "../data/facts";
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="What FloMasters does with the details you give when you book or ask for a callback.">
  <PageHero title="Privacy" lead="What happens to the details you give me" />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="draft"><strong>Draft.</strong> This page is a plain-language starting point for the prototype. It needs a proper review once the booking system and its storage are chosen.</p>
      <h2>What I collect</h2>
      <p>When you book or ask for a callback: the job, your arrival window, the address, your mobile number, and anything you choose to add (your name, a photo of the problem).</p>
      <h2>What I use it for</h2>
      <p>Only to do the job: to confirm the visit, text you updates, find your house, and keep a record of the work for your guarantee. I don't sell or share your details, and I don't send marketing texts.</p>
      <h2>How long I keep it</h2>
      <p>Job records are kept for as long as your guarantee and my tax records need them. Ask and I'll delete anything I don't have to keep.</p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Call <a href={`tel:${facts.phoneHref.value}`}>{facts.phone.value}</a> or email <Fact k="email" />.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 46rem; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: var(--step-2); margin-top: var(--space-4); }
  .draft { background: #fff4cc; border: 1px solid #f0d27a; padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem; border-radius: var(--radius); }
</style>
